  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the grill to medium high heat.",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together coconut cream, olive oil, lemon juice, garlic, cumin, paprika, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Add the chicken to the bowl and toss to coat with the marinade.",
    "Thread the marinated chicken onto skewers, leaving a small space between each piece.",
    "Grill the chicken kebabs for 10-12 minutes, turning occasionally, until cooked through.",
    "While the chicken is cooking, heat the confit tomato in a saucepan over low heat.",
    "Serve the chicken kebabs with the warmed confit tomato spooned over the top.",
    "Garnish with fresh parsley or cilantro, if desired."
  ],
